<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee weakens vs dlr, up against pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee weakens vs dlr, up against pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee weakened slightly against the dollar and strengthened versus the British pound on Tuesday, reflecting international market trends, foreign exchange dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee traded at a mean commercial rate of 21.829 to the dollar from 21.7435 on Monday and at 35.0255 to the pound against 35.0855.</p>
<p>--Clifford Vellien ++230 211-9555</p>
